{"4052670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sands Of Avalon: Forge Your Legend", "steam_appid": 4052670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5016930], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/40683c04b1bcecfb0700fca00534b3af.avif?t=1788332399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras_big/40683c04b1bcecfb0700fca00534b3af.webp?t=1788332399 width=1560 height=877 /></span> <br> <br> <br>Forge your legend in <strong>Sands of Avalon</strong>, a dungeon-crawling ARPG inspired entirely by the ancient world.<br>Choose your path as a warrior, ranger, or mage from civilizations shaped by  Egyptian mysticism, Roman discipline and other forgotten cultures of antiquity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices define you — the god you follow, the blessings and curses you carry, and how you shape your character through a deep passive skill tree.<br>Explore dangerous dungeons, face powerful bosses, join guilds, and fight rival factions as you carve your story into Avalon’s ancient sands.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Character Progression</strong> – Create unique builds through a massive passive skill tree with notables and keystones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/adc2c6668da4d4402ba087e09994df06.avif?t=1788332399\" width=1560 height=698 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Core Classes, Three Races</strong> – Choose between Warriors, Mages, and Rangers across Egyptian and Roman lineages<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/e9a300b201466132ae4aaf73d8c1ea1b.avif?t=1788332399\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/cd876803a73521b32ed2fe4295bfcd95.avif?t=1788332399\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/7bb35811fe47f9164d89024b5773650a.avif?t=1788332399\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God Allegiance System</strong> – Align with ancient gods like Anubis or Ra for powerful blessings and dangerous curses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/deae0652b517f0594f27929608c47f44.avif?t=1788332399\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/f8c6f4c5fb65e903b34333e37a5c7b9d.avif?t=1788332399\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Adventure</strong> – Traverse diverse biomes, hub zones, and instanced dungeons filled with secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Economy</strong> – Gather resources, craft gear, and trade through a dynamic in-game marketplace powered by AI with real economic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE &amp; PvP Combat</strong> – Challenge fearsome monsters, conquer dungeons, and engag